@startuml
title UC-06 - Đăng nhập bằng tài khoản nội bộ

autonumber
hide footbox

actor Developer
actor "Platform Operator" as Operator
boundary "Authentication Web UI (React)" as UI
boundary "Local User CLI" as CLI
control "Authentication API / Controller" as API
control "Authentication Middleware" as Middleware
control "Authentication Service" as Service
control "Login Rate Limiter" as Limiter
control "Password Hasher" as Hasher
control "Session Manager" as Sessions
entity "User Account Repository" as Users
entity "Auth Session Repository" as SessionRepo
entity "Login Attempt Repository" as AttemptRepo

group Provision tài khoản trước lần đăng nhập đầu tiên
  Operator -> CLI: createLocalUser(username, displayName)
  CLI -> CLI: đọc + xác nhận password bằng prompt ẩn
  CLI -> Service: createLocalUser(username, displayName, password)
  Service -> Hasher: hash(password, Argon2id)
  Hasher --> Service: encodedPasswordHash
  Service -> Users: createAccountAndCredential(...)
  Users --> Service: Local User Account ACTIVE
  Service --> CLI: user đã được tạo
end

group Supporting account lifecycle (khi Operator yêu cầu)
  Operator -> CLI: resetLocalPassword(username)
  CLI -> CLI: đọc + xác nhận password mới bằng prompt ẩn
  CLI -> Service: resetLocalPassword(username, newPassword)
  Service -> Hasher: hash(newPassword, Argon2id)
  Hasher --> Service: encodedPasswordHash
  group Một database transaction
    Service -> Users: replacePassword(userId, hash)
    Service -> SessionRepo: revokeAll(userId)
  end
  Service --> CLI: password đã reset

  Operator -> CLI: setLocalUserStatus(username, status)
  CLI -> Service: setLocalUserStatus(username, status)
  group Một database transaction
    Service -> Users: setStatus(userId, status)
    Service -> SessionRepo: revokeAll(userId) nếu DISABLED
  end
  Service --> CLI: status đã cập nhật
end

Developer -> Middleware: GET protectedPath (không có session hợp lệ)
Middleware --> Developer: 303 /ui/login?return_to=protectedPath
Developer -> UI: mở trang đăng nhập
UI -> API: GET /api/auth/login-context?return_to=protectedPath
API --> UI: pre-auth CSRF nonce + safe returnTo
UI --> Developer: form Username/Password
Developer -> UI: chọn Sign in
UI -> API: POST /api/auth/login JSON\ncredentials + returnTo + CSRF header
API -> API: validate Origin/Fetch Metadata + nonce
API -> Service: signIn(..., requestSource)
Service -> Limiter: check(normalizedUsername, requestSource)
Limiter -> AttemptRepo: load/update attempt buckets
AttemptRepo --> Limiter: allowed
Service -> Users: findByNormalizedUsername(username)
Users --> Service: account + encoded hash hoặc not found
Service -> Hasher: verify(password, encoded hash/dummy hash)
Hasher --> Service: valid / invalid

alt account ACTIVE và password hợp lệ
  Service -> Sessions: createSession(userId)
  Sessions -> SessionRepo: save(tokenHash, csrfHash, expiries)
  SessionRepo --> Sessions: session persisted
  Sessions --> Service: raw token + raw CSRF token
  Service --> API: success + session material
  API --> UI: Set-Cookie session/CSRF; 200 redirectTo
  UI --> Developer: window.location.assign(redirectTo)
else thông tin không hợp lệ
  Service -> Limiter: recordFailure(username, requestSource)
  Limiter -> AttemptRepo: persist buckets
  Service --> API: generic invalid-credentials result
  API --> UI: cùng một lỗi đăng nhập, không tạo cookie
end

Developer -> Middleware: request được bảo vệ + session cookie
Middleware -> Sessions: authenticateRequest(raw token)
Sessions -> SessionRepo: findActiveByTokenHash(tokenHash)
SessionRepo --> Sessions: session hoặc not found
Sessions -> Users: findActiveAccount(session.userId)
Users --> Sessions: account ACTIVE hoặc invalid
Sessions --> Middleware: Principal hoặc unauthenticated
Middleware --> Developer: chuyển request tới handler hoặc 401/redirect

Developer -> UI: chọn Sign out
UI -> API: POST /api/auth/logout + CSRF header
API -> Sessions: revokeCurrentSession(tokenHash)
Sessions -> SessionRepo: set revokedAt
API --> UI: 204; xóa cookie
UI --> Developer: điều hướng /ui/login?reason=logged-out

@enduml
